      "type": "practice",
      "subtopic": "Test Paper · Section A",
      "question": "Which of the following is not a rational number?\n\n(a) $0$\n(b) $-\\dfrac{7}{1}$\n(c) $\\sqrt{2}$\n(d) $\\dfrac{5}{0}$",
